# text_id = 1644
# text = The fact that the weekly cost of relief has been reduced from £ 28,055 to £ 5,769 a week suggests that in the two years that have passed since the appointment of the new guardians 18,000 malingerers have been eliminated , but nobody believes for a moment that that total represents the percentage of malingerers among the working classes .
