# text = As a matter of fact , the Amendment which Lord Desborough is to move presently defines the word " exhibit " as meaning an exhibit at any entertainment to which the public are admitted , whether on payment of money or otherwise , and defines the expression " train " as referring to training for the purpose of any such exhibition .
