# text = Therefore , associating myself with the general view of the right hon . Gentleman the Member for Norwich ( Mr. Hilton Young ) , I would say that what we ought to do now , generally , is actually to produce what is a minimum necessity , whilst we are very actively exploring two other fields cognate to actual production .
