# text_id = 1664
# text = Had that been the case perhaps our deliberations would not have been quite so harmonious , but it was not necessary for my right hon . Friend to draw upon his imagination , because , before the end of the speech of the Chancellor of the Exchequer , we had an occular illustration of the harmony which prevails within the Cabinet .
