# text = Reports have been received from certain of the prisoners of war recently in Russia to the effect that Mr. Lansbury had spoken to them in Moscow in praise of the Bolshevik régime and in favour of Socialism generally , but I have no evidence to the effect that he suborned , or endeavoured to suborn , their allegiance to His Majesty .
