# text = The amount of this grant was based on the estimated difference between the cost of maintenance in workhouses and in asylums , respectively , and while it is true that the cost of maintenance in an asylum has increased since the grant was fixed , it is equally true that the cost of maintenance in a workhouse has also increased .
