# text_id = 1693
# text = Mr. AMMON asked the Postmaster - General whether the Treasury sanction was given on the l5th September , 1921 , for the revised rates of pay for salaried sub - postmasters ; if so , in how many instances has this recommendation been carried out ; and when it is proposed to apply the new scale to all officers concerned ?
