# text_id = 1695
# text = I am reminded of the history of the long working - class struggle that goes back to the days of Peterloo , when men fought and struggled and died for political privileges , believing in the long run they would influence finally the conditions of poverty , and climb out of that poverty , if political privileges were allowed to them .
