# text_id = 1718
# text = We are here to - night to demand the surrender of the German war criminals who have committed atrocities upon our men and our allies , and it seems a totally irrelevant and mischievous suggestion to say , without any evidence whatever being produced , that some of our allies have committed atrocities against I do not know whom .
