# text = The Bill already provides , in Clause 2 , subsection ( 2 ) that the minimum permissible pressure shall be such pressure in any main , or any pipe laid between the main and the meter having an internal diameter of 2 inches and upwards , as to balance a column of water not less than 2 inches in height .
