# text_id = 1739
# text = I welcome this Bill very warmly , even though it probably does not go nearly as far as I should like it to go , but I value its introduction chiefly for one reason , a reason which was given very clearly and lucidly by my right hon . Friend the Minister of Agriculture himself in introducing the Bill this afternoon .
