# text_id = 1756
# text = The old London dock authority put their chief constable on the board of guardians at one time , for no other reason than that his friends — undertakers , parsons and doctors — Freemasons most of them were — should take good care that this representative of what was called the bigger ratepayers should be the chairman of that committee .
