# text_id = 1764
# text = The Traffic Committee and their experts — they have technical advisers as well — are of opinion that the population living adjacent to London could not be brought into or taken out of London without the help of the tramways , and that it was senseless competition to have a number of omnibuses running over exactly the same routes .
