# text_id = 1770
# text = If the mechanics at the municipal aerodromes and the pilots flying in commercial companies were enrolled as a matter of course , just as the officers and most of the seamen in our great shipping lines are as a matter of course members of the Royal Naval Reserve , that alone would do much to help on civil aviation .
