# text_id = 1771
# text = After all , is it not rather a foolish thing to spend so much money on advertising Empire products , invitations to buy Empire goods , and yet while we give that invitation , we allow a state of things to exist whereby manipulators and financial sharks of all kinds are able to rob both the producer and the public ?
