# text_id = 1772
# text = The right hon . Gentleman , strange to say , with the support of the Conservative party , and with the support of industrialists who understand British industry as he does not , support him in the policy merely because it gives effect momentarily to the principles of competition and lack of Government control to which they give a theoretic support .
