# text_id = 1773
# text = Mr. RAFFAN asked the Secretary of State for the Colonies whether any agreed definition has been reached by the Powers signatory to the convention of St. Germain as to what constitutes trade spirits for the purposes of that convention ; and whether he is aware that in practice to - day varying interpretations are being adopted by the several Powers ?
