# text_id = 1785
# text = The very fact that under this Resolution we are making Parliament ridiculous and preventing any opportunity for free discussion in the Mother of Parliaments , will certainly compel all who are opposed to the Bill to make redoubled efforts to convince the country that the country is right in its present interpretation of what this Bill is going to do .
