# text_id = 1788
# text = We now have the extraordinary theory that , if you take a man who is unemployed in Durham , and put him down in Birmingham , where there is considerable unemployment , you are assisting the aggregate of employment if that man from Durham puts a man , who is in a job in Birmingham , out of that job .
