# text_id = 1805
# text = Because something has been established a long time , many hon . Members think it ought to be altered , and I am indeed sorry to find that hon . and right hon . Gentlemen on the Front Bench too often countenance those things and do not rather relegate them to the schools of thought from which they spring .
