# text_id = 1807
# text = I do submit that it is a reasonable proposition that licensing hours should be fixed not merely to please those who never use licensed premises any more than we would open picture galleries to please the blind , or have concerts arranged at hours convenient to the deaf , but in the main , those who do use licensed premises .
