# text_id = 1808
# text = From this one might draw a practical moral , and it is the knowledge that these funds were there needlessly devoted to the redemption of debt last year , should encourage the Government to adopt a larger scheme of trade facilities by enlarging the amount which the Treasury can guarantee for the assistance of development work more especially overseas .
