# text = Everyone is agreed that the original object should be achieved , and I beg the Chancellor to reconsider the proposal made by the hon . Member ( Mr. Herbert ) in order that these objections may be met and that we may not have still another millstone round the neck of small companies who are struggling to regain their prosperity .
