# text_id = 1824
# text = The difficulty of balancing Budgets is one with which we are not wholly unfamiliar in this House , but in countries that depend almost wholly , if not wholly , upon a single staple product , when that staple product has fallen into the universal slump the difficulty of balancing Budgets is far more severe than any we have here .
