# text_id = 1825
# text = Is the right hon . Gentleman aware that a few years ago taxi - cabs were actually plying with 7 - inch clearances , and they were put out of commission by order of the Commissioner of Police That was a grievance at the time , and does he not think that putting it back to 7 inches multiplies the grievance ?
