# text_id = 1844
# text = I do not wish to dilate upon this because I have spoken upon the matter before , but it is really impossible to exaggerate the discomfort , damage to health and property , and unnecessary expense to which many millions of our people are continually exposed day by day , and from which the great majority of our population suffer , as the result of this state of affairs .
