# text_id = 1845
# text = My hon . Friend is very well aware that while the practice in past times may have had the result of producing only raw sugar in certain sugar factories , that modern practice . has gone — as one would have anticipated it would , having regard to the development of every other form of business — in favour of uniting the production of raw sugar with its refining .
