# text = I have , been very much interested in the appeal which has just been made to the House by the hon . and gallant Member for Ohertsey ( Sir P. Richardson ) , especially as I am connecting it with an earlier attack upon these benches by the hon . Gentleman the Member for North Bradford ( Mr. Ramsden ) , who seconded the Amendment which we are still discussing .
