# text = But , when once you concede that it is right and proper to have a register of moneylenders , I do not understand how it can be argued that it is improper to have some system whereby steps can be taken to secure , so far as is possible , that only persons who are fit and proper persons to pursue the vocation of moneylending shall get upon the register .
