# text = In connection with Clause 5 — which lays it down that where repayments are made by instalments there shall be a note showing how much of each instalment is principal and how much is interest , there would be no difficulty — I think , in having tables prepared showing , in connection with any repayment , how much of the instalment is principal and how much is interest .
