# text = In this particular case , however , and , indeed , in many others throughout the country , you have the example of this great enterprise acquiring large businesses which were previously carried on by private enterprise , absorbing them into their co-operative network , and then at once securing immunity from payment of the ordinary taxation which was incidental to the previous conduct of those businesses in private hands .
