# text = Colonel DAY asked the Secretary of State for the Home Department if he is aware that licensed car - park keepers at various ranks in the West End , who are licensed by the Commissioner of Police , are not in receipt of any salary and have to rely entirely on tips ; and will he consider the introduction of legislation having as its object the payment of these public servants ?
