# text_id = 1865
# text = I remember the occasion on which the Prime Minister made his statement regarding this legislation , and I say without hesitation , nay with every confidence , that not one single Member of this House on that occasion even dreamt for a second that the date he mentioned was a date to be taken seriously and fixed as the date of the commencement of the operation of this Measure .
