# text_id = 1866
# text = The hon . Member for Leith ( Mr. E. Brown ) has pointed out that the County of Durham will lose something over £ 1,000,000 in rateable value , while the County of Surrey will lose quite a small sum , the difference being due to the fact that in the County of Durham there are a larger number of hereditaments which are to be de-rated under the scheme .
