# text_id = 1867
# text = In their Report , on page 9 , the Transference Board deal with the 130,000 cases examined of wholly unemployed miners , and then they give the different age groups of those miners , and they say that there are 1,300 of them under 18 years of age ; but when you come to the group between 18 and 25 , there are 30,000 men in that one group .
