# text_id = 1873
# text = Some of them are quite reasonable , and I thoroughly approve of them , but others are most far - reaching and most unreasonable , and with regard to the action of the Board of Trade in sanctioning or accepting these proposals without getting the sanction , so far as I know , of either House , that is a question which I propose to raise upon the next occasion .
