# text_id = 1874
# text = It certainly was not contemplated that it should do as it did just over a year ago , namely , set itself up as an alternative Government , and when the Trade Unions Congress proceeds to take on political ends of that kind , to all intents and purposes , it is time enough to say definitely that no longer can civil servants be affiliated to the Trade Unions Congress .
