# text_id = 1875
# text = The right hon . Gentleman has met them as far as that part of their demand is concerned , but they also ask — - and I , who am not a Protestant , think they are quite justified in asking — that , just as the other religious bodies , the Catholics and Episcopalians , are to have co-opted representation on the education committee , they should have representation also .
