# text = I will conclude by hoping that the Parliamentary Secretary will give some reply to the questions which have been put to him by the hon . Members for East Ham , North , Stratford and Silvertown and to the question which I have put , which is very important , and see whether he can state the total amount of principal or interest that this present board of guardians have paid .
