# text = I may safely assert that I have among my colleagues many men of great experience , and your Lordships may take it from me that the arguments in relation to the retention of the bread subsidy , at the time when the decision was reached by the Cabinet , were such that a number of sensible , well - intentioned and not wholly inexperienced men found to be overwhelming .
