# text = Provided that where by virtue of the said Sub-section any person is at the commencement of this Act disqualified for the receipt of benefit in the third special period , he shall continue to be so disqualified until the expiration of five weeks from the date on which he began to be so disqualified , or the expiration of one week from the commencement of this Act , whichever first happens .
