# text = The sum to be expended this year is much less than it was last year , and last year was much less than the year before , but I should hesitate to say how many almost hundreds of millions have been spent during the last four years , and yet this city , which is the heart of the Empire , is vulnerable to the attack of a neighbouring Power .
