# text_id = 1883
# text = Whatever we may have said on this side of the House in regard to the special constabulary we at least appeal to the Home Secretary , if the Government are going to have special constables , that they at least will place themselves under statutory provision , and that the Act shall say " shall " and not " may " — " shall " grant gratuities , etc .
