# text_id = 1885
# text = There is an interlinking of security and reduction of armaments and no one who has any knowledge of what goes on at Geneva can doubt for a moment that , if at the International Conference there is anything like agree - ment that amendments are required within the detailed terms of the Protocol , such amendments will certainly be adopted , so far as the Assembly of the League is concerned .
