# text_id = 1886
# text = If we are to get good mechanics , good engineers and men who will make the Army what it ought to be , namely , the most scientific force that any country could possess , we must give them not only good conditions and good pay while they are in the Army , but we must do everything we can to see that they have prospects when they leave the Army .
