# text_id = 1887
# text = I have pointed out to your Lordships that on three or four separate occasions the Church had undertaken , in the fullest possible manner that it could officially do so , to raise larger sums of money than anybody was likely to have raised in any other manner ; to see to it that the money so raised should be properly administered , and to help in every possible way .
