# text = I think it is a very strong step to empower two magistrates — very often gentlemen who give their services to the country , but who are quite without training in the matter of weighing evidence — to convict a man who is driving a motor lorry and send him to prison for four months for a first offence on what is very often simply a matter of opinion .
