# text = The fact that my hon . Friend the Member for Petersfield ( Mr. W. Nicholson ) , had put his name down to Second my Amendment , and that he has been for a long time the Member for that part of the diocese which it is proposed to separate , is sufficient proof that there is a large body of opinion among his constituents opposed to this Scheme .
