# text_id = 1894
# text = And as regards the disabled ex-service man , may I be permitted at once to thank so many of my colleagues in this House for their kindly efforts on their behalf during the recess , and to thank no less the Lord - Lieutenants of counties , the Lord Mayors , Mayors , and Chairmen of district council municipalities for their recent special efforts on behalf of the disabled ex-service men .
