# text_id = 1895
# text = I am only taking human nature as it is , and what happened yesterday may — I hope it will not — happen in connection with the operation of this Bill if you do not accept the Amendment , and if the Government believe that the Bill was a better Bill without the provision in it I would appeal to the Government even at the eleventh hour to accept the Amendment .
