# text_id = 1896
# text = But , up to the present , the mere abolition of the gap in itself , and by itself , is of no assistance to local authorities , and I am confirmed in that by the fact that in connection with that Bill there were no financial Resolutions , pointing clearly to the fact that that Bill in itself could not add one penny piece extra charge to the Treasury .
