# text_id = 1900
# text = Between those two extremes there is quite a large number of definite schemes in existence all of which aim more or less directly , more or less completely , at maintaining the existing organisation of industry in its main lines but recognise that it can only succeed , at any rate that it can best succeed , by the closest co-operation between all those who are engaged in it .
