# text = The 13 subsidised light aeroplane clubs , including the club mentioned by my hon . Friend , are already receiving Government assistance on a much more liberal scale than that proposed for National Flying Services , Limited , while they are under no similar obligation as regards the provision and maintenance of a chain of aerodromes and landing grounds as a condi- tion of the grant of the subsidy .
