# text = He introduced a Supplementary Estimate earlier in the year and made an interesting speech , and last week , when the Colonial Office Vote was before us , we had a very interesting statement from the Under - Secretary of State , followed by a general Debate and a Debate on the question of Palestine , which occupied the attention of the Committee from 8 o'clock till 11 o'clock .
