# text_id = 1904
# text = I appeal , therefore , to the Chancellor of the Exchequer and the Prime Minister that , as they are going to vary the custom and practice which has held good up to the present of making grants from the National Exchequer , that variation should be a fair variation all round , and should not be given simply to one section of the community and denied to another .
