# text_id = 1905
# text = I wish to intervene for a minute or two because I have been informed — I am sorry that I was not in the House at the time — that the Lord Advocate , in the course of his speech in support of the Amendment , made use of a quotation from a speech of mine as a plea for the continuation of sectarian religious education in the Scottish schools .
