# text_id = 1907
# text = If we pass this Bill , we shall be able to see whether the beneficial results which have been found in places like London and Manchester , where the local authorities in the past have had power to inspect maternity homes — whether the improvement in the treatment given in those homes — will be paralleled in the case of nursing homes under the inspection provided by this Bill .
