# text = It is only fair to remember also , though we constantly see upon that bench the most rev . Primate and some of his colleagues , that it is inevitable in the circumstances of the ease that the ecclesiastical and spiritual duties the Bishops , often in distant parts of the country , render it for the most part impossible for them to give a regular attendance at our proceedings .
