# text = The policy of the Government ought to have been to have looked at the problem and to have seen what would be the effect of the policy upon certain sections of the people , and , having done so , they ought to have considered what was best to be done in order to alleviate the hardships that would be thrown upon those sections of the people by their financial policy .
