# text = Passing to the financial questions involved by the Bill , I have noticed that during the whole of these discussions there has been a curious , and , perhaps , wise reluctance on the part of the Treasury to be present very much in the House , but we have arrived , or , rather , we arrived by the end of last evening , at a very curious position .
