# text_id = 1917
# text = It seems to me that in any case there ought to be some very convincing reason for keeping in internment a number of civilians — women , old men , and children — more especially in view of the fact that these unfortunate people have already passed one hot weather season in Egypt in an internment camp , and have now the prospect before them of passing yet another .
