# text_id = 1919
# text = I will not anticipate the discussion which may take place at a later stage on new Clauses , but I would point out that if you decrease the number of companies which are concerned with this Tax , and if you have to produce the same amount of money from the tax , you thereby increase the amount of tax which will fall upon those companies that are liable to it .
