# text_id = 1920
# text = This is not the time , even if it were desirable , to enter into the realms of controversy , but the fact remains that , while peoples of old and new civilisations all over the world live proudly and contentedly in common Imperial bonds with us , the people of our kin , nearest to our shores , have demanded by a majority a change in their Imperial connection .
