# text_id = 1921
# text = He may make that kind of speech to Conservative Primrose League audiences and at smoking concerts in Maldon , but as he goes up and down he will find that there are people dwelling on the countryside , as there are people dwelling in the great cities , who are taking very seriously certain of the major proposals of the real Liberal land policy , not this caricature in this book .
