# text_id = 1930
# text = If , however , the Bill is intended to deal with more than West Ham it is a really revolutionary Measure , which strikes at the root of local government in this country , because the right hon . Gentleman could , next week , if the Bill were then law , entirely destroy for the time being one - tenth of the boards of guardians in this country .
