# text = It has been said that the alternative to raiding this Road Fund would be to put an extra 4d . in the £ on our Income Tax , but , as has been said here this afternoon , we know that Income Tax is only paid by people who have got incomes , but that road rates are paid for by everybody , whether they have incomes or no incomes .
