# text = The hon . Gentleman told us during the Debate that the excess for medical benefit was drawn from a certain source , and at this moment the source was being drained and , unless sonic Clause of the Bill made out a provision for the extra medical fees , the donation would be 3s . per patient short as a result of diverting that Clause for a period of 12 months .
