# text_id = 1941
# text = There is no Standing Order of the House dealing with this matter , but hon . Members who study Erskine May will find there a very good maxim , which seems to me to reproduce accurately the practice of the House in this regard , to the effect that matters which are awaiting adjudication in a Court of Law should not be raised in Debate on the Floor of the House .
