# text_id = 1942
# text = We feel , the Committee felt , the Government feel and I believe your Lordships will feel , that this great reform can be carried out and should be carried out without endangering any legitimate interests , without interfering in any way with the historical development of the University by trying forcibly to make the London University conform to the ordinary idea or practices of Universities very differently situated .
