# text = Obviously , if you have to pay one - twenty - fifth of a penny per pound weight , it is a certain sum of money , but , with rubber at round about 1s . per pound , as it is to - day , it will amount to one - three - hundredth part of the cost of that pound of rubber , which is not a great amount .
