# text_id = 1947
# text = On three occasions it has secured a Second Reading , on two occasions without a Division an I once with a Division , when it passed through the Committee subject to an Amendment which was suggested by the Government , and when , had it not been for an unfortunate accident which prevented it securing a Third Reading , it would undoubtedly have been placed upon the Statute Book .
