# text = Here is an Economy Bill which , as the back of it shows , is presented to the House of Commons by the Chancellor of the Exchequer , and the astonishing thing is that , as each important matter comes up , some junior colleague of the Chancellor of the Exchequer is so good as to provide him with the necessities of defence while the Chancellor of the Exchequer stays away .
