# text = I am not talking about what the Society of Friends have done , or other far - sighted people , but I am talking about what Parliament is doing with the mass of the community , and I say the whole thing is wiped off the slate so far as any continuation schools are concerned , and even where the local authorities did make a start you wipe it off too .
