# text = If , on the other hand , the whole of the societies , just as they have combined at present and appointed an executive committee to represent them , should combine to lay their case before the Commission by counsel , you would have the important difference that counsel would be able to consolidate and present their case without overlapping , and thus you would save a great deal of time .
