# text_id = 1955
# text = From this Debate has emerged the policy of the Labour party , spoken to in no uncertain terms by the right hon . Member for Colne Valley yesterday and repeated without withdrawal or apology or regret to - day , a policy which the leader of the Labour party was given the opportunity of disowning , an opportunity which one would have thought he would have been glad to have taken .
