# text_id = 1956
# text = In conclusion , if we wish to raise the Royal Air Force to a one - Power standard , on the basis of the present French strength , we shall have to face immediately an expenditure of £ 23,000,000 per annum ; whilst , if and when the full French programme of expansion is carried into effect , this figure will have to be increased to £ 35,000,000 per annum .
