# text = During one of the discussions I was reminded by the hon . Member for Moray and Nairn ( Mr. Stuart ) that I had intimated I would provide so much money to assist co-operation in agriculture to assist the agriculturists of Scotland in building up a system of co-operation that would enable them to get greater benefits from their industry than the system under which they have worked hitherto has provided .
