# text_id = 1960
# text = It does seem to me that in the discussions regarding Free Trade and tariffs and sweated goods , there is only one way out , and that is to so arrange the conditions of labour throughout the world that they will be standardised as far as possible , and that having standardised them we shall then proceed to find out whether further reforms are possible in this or that country .
