# text_id = 1961
# text = On the second Reading some doubt was expressed by one or two speakers who supported the Bill as to whether these feathers could last as long as seven years without deteriorating , so as to make them valueless , and I think the Paymaster - General and my noble friend opposite spent an unnecessary amount of time in trying to show that these feathers will last longer than seven years .
