# text_id = 1964
# text = I think there is far greater terror and fear on the part of the trade unions than there need be in thinking that a body of men who are artisans and mechanics , and not soldiers in the normal sense at all , would be used by the State , whatever Government is in power , ruthlessly and recklessly to break down a strike of their own fellow workers .
