# text = In the course of that debate , whilst I was not altogether in agreement with noble Lords , it became clear that there was a large measure of agreement between us with regard to alternatives to the power to enforce the improvement of grass land , and , in fact , to carry out the stimulation of good farming so long as there was no possibility of orders to plough .
