# text_id = 1967
# text = If I had an opportunity of taking £ 770,000 per annum away from the landlord class — whether they are parasites or not , and I would discriminate , because we must discriminate between one person and another as a landlord — I would pass over the whole of that sum , as we are now seeking to do , to the industrious class in the community for whom I speak .
