# text_id = 1969
# text = I believe the sugar - beet industry is in the process of saving him from practical extinction , and the measure of the success of the sugar - beet industry is not the crop and the acreage of the sugar - beet crop this year , but it is the very much larger acreage of the arable land which is affected by the sugar - beet grown in rotation .
