# text_id = 1970
# text = We know how in cases of this nature the snowball grows , and if this huge sum is spent now at a time when we cannot and ought not to spend it , I venture to say that we shall see the day when the Government will be asking for a still larger sum in respect of the maintenance and repair of the buildings we are asked to erect .
