# text_id = 1973
# text = Taking a much larger range of taxes from the same source , I find that with regard to sugar , tea , coffee , cocoa and dried fruits , with the addition of tobacco , in 1920 the percentage of tax upon the workers of this country was 28·04 per cent . ; in 1921 it was 37·77 per cent . , and in 1922 it was 41·94 per cent .
