# text_id = 1974
# text = If it is decided to adopt a one - Power standard in the air with France , on the naval analogy , it would mean an immediate increase over our gross Estimate for 1923 – 24 of about £ 5,000,000 , but it would mean an eventual increase of £ 17,000,000 per annum , in order to keep pace with France , if she continues to expand as at present proposed .
