# text_id = 1975
# text = As soon as other nations begin to use the argument that , because we plague their subjects , they are justified in plaguing ours in return , the game will not be worth the candle , and we should do very much better if we abolished the officials and the visa system , even if it can be so administered as to bring in a little more than it costs .
