# text_id = 1977
# text = The Chancellor of the Exchequer , the other day , gave an assurance that this would be so ; but we would like to have a further assurance from the Minister of Transport , because previous Chancellors of the Exchequer have given assurances that the Road Fund would not he touched , and we would like an assurance that the Roads Department will still be carried on as one single Department .
