# text_id = 1978
# text = We are not representatives of any section or any type , and , therefore , I thought something should be said on this side to show that we want to support the Government in maintaining an efficient Navy , and we want also to assure them that we will back them up if they will let the Admiralty produce what they consider necessary up to and within certain definite lines .
