# text_id = 1979
# text = Next year we are to lay down three and the year afterwards three , until finally , including the two Australian cruisers , we are to have a Fleet of 73 , all of which but nine or ten will have been laid down since the outbreak of the War , and which , the Admiralty tell us , will give us the margin of security at which they are aiming .
