# text = The most rev . Primate , with a degree of hardihood — if I may use that expression without disrespect of one whose office and personality I revere — has ventured to call attention to the speeches and the prophecies which were made on that occasion by the supporters of the Bill But what of the speeches and the predictions that were made by the most rev Primate and his friends ?
