# text = Here , again , the policy of concentration , both of building and of administration , has been carried through , and , assuming it is the fact , as I have no doubt careful examination has shown , that this is the best way of administering this work , again I say with the greatest confidence that the purchase will pay for itself as a reasonable and economical proposition .
