# text_id = 1988
# text = I should like to say at once that I would not for a moment suggest that the Noble Lord is trying to take advantage of us in any improper way , but I do think that , apart from this particular Measure , the general point is one of very great interest , and that the considerations advanced by my hon . and gallant Friend are very relevant and powerful .
