# text_id = 1990
# text = I can quite understand that , but the blame which they are getting in the matter they have earned , because before the Election they promised to do the very things which the correspondence I have received shows the public now want them to do , and it is because they have misled the public for the purpose of the last Election , that retribution is now falling upon their heads .
