# text_id = 1991
# text = I want it to he perfectly well understood that , in my opinion , the people of this country will not hesitate to supply the necessary funds to that part of Ireland which is anxious to live in peace and amity with us , and I am sure it will scrutinise in the severest manner any attempt to place upon us the burden of the acts of our avowed enemies .
