# text = If you asked a true scientist which he would choose , to be the richest man in the world , or to receive the greatest honour that any Sovereign could bestow upon him , or to discover a new element , he would look at you in mild surprise and wonder that there could be any doubt in your mind that the money and the order would mean nothing to him .
