# text_id = 1994
# text = In 1921 , parity in capital ships , both cruisers and battleships , having been agreed upon at Washington , the fact that we led the way with our tremendous number of ships at that time naturally led to corresponding programmes in other countries , and I really think that the right hon . Gentleman does no good at all by pretending that we have led the way in disarmament .
