# text_id = 1996
# text = I regret that I must oppose this Amendment , and for this reason , that before the House can amend the law it must be satisfied , first of all , of the nature and extent of the defect of the law which it is to remedy , and , secondly , it must be satisfied that the offence is defined in the Bill in a way which will be workable .
