# text_id = 1998
# text = Ordered , That the Committee have Mower , if they so determine , to sit as two Committees , and in that event to apportion the Bills referred to the Committee between the two Committees , each of which shall have the full powers of and be subject to the instructions which apply to the undivided Committee , and that Four be the quorum of each of the two Committees .
