# text_id = 1999
# text = If there has been one criticism directed against this Bill — and indeed against the whole business of government at the present time — which is stronger than another , it is the objection to what is commonly called the army of officials which , in connection with legislation , descends upon the countryside or the town in order to see that the provisions of various Acts are observed .
