# text_id = 2000
# text = I have taken the trouble to discuss this matter with the Sheriff and with others concerned , and the conclusion I have come to is that , by securing this Clause , we can increase the number of polling stations and give increased facilities to the people in these admittedly very difficult districts , and I think that polling on a single day will be of great advantage to everyone concerned .
