# text_id = 2002
# text = Perhaps I may be allowed to express my great regret that the Marquess Curzon of Kedleston has passed away , and is not able to take part in this debate , because , on every occasion on which we have had an opportunity of discussing it , he always showed great sympathy with the object that we have in view , and took a great interest in the question .
