# text = It is , on the other hand , equally desirable , both from the point of view of the consumer and from that of the honest trader , not to underrate the opportunity which the absence of adequate protection affords for giving short weight and measure , or the extent to which some traders , as shown by the detailed evidence before us , take advantage of these opportunities .
