# text_id = 2004
# text = If Members of this House deliberately condone a breach of faith on the part of the Government ; if they sanction that breach of faith ; if , by their votes , they enable that breach of faith to become operative , then I say we Members of this House are parties to that breach of faith , and we make ourselves responsible for it just as much as the Government .
