# text_id = 2008
# text = I do not say that we have not scrapped as much as other people , but the fact remains , and I am bound to admit it , that , when the shipbuilding programme was commenced after the Washington Conference , the Labour Government , having inherited the Estimates of the Conservative Government and being in a minority in this House , were over - borne by naval opinion .
