# text_id = 2010
# text = The Post Office give in their returns a good deal in advance in preparation for the printing of the Directory , and , therefore , as I understood the hon . Gentleman to say that this sum was mostly required in connection with the enlargement of the Post Office Telephone Directory , I think we ought to have had much closer budgeting at the time when the original Estimates were presented .
