# text_id = 2012
# text = I have been silent , too , because I have great confidence in the present Foreign Secretary , and outside Ireland I have great confidence in my hon . Friend the Member for Canterbury ( Mr. R. McNeill ) , who represents the Foreign Office in this House , and I should like to congratulate him most heartily on what I regard as a tardy recognition of his great Parliamentary gifts .
