# text_id = 2013
# text = In the first place , we tried by extending and amending the export credits scheme and by offering Government guarantees for loans up to £ 25,000,000 for capital undertakings which would promote employment , to do what we could to get at the root of the trouble and produce an increase of employment , where it is beyond question most valuable , in the normal industries and occupations of the people .
