# text_id = 2014
# text = Not the least important in this connection is , of course , the training of native medical staffs , and we hope to increase that work , which has grown remarkably in the last few years all over West and East Africa , and to build up an even higher medical training of natives so as to enable them to qualify in Africa for the actual conduct and treatment of cases .
