# text_id = 2017
# text = We are to use public credit for the purpose of enabling them to get a loan at as low a rate of interest as possible in the market , so that they can promote enterprises which would utilise the work of the workless , in cases where they could not get money in the market either at all or at any reasonable rate of interest unless the public intervened .
