# text_id = 2019
# text = In another sense , however , it is an Amendment of substance , and it has been devised for the sole purpose of including within the provisions of this Bill an extension of the Rating and Valuation ( Apportionment ) Act of 1928 in order to include within the rating provisions of this Bill single men businesses and in order to make certain that de-rating shall apply to them .
