# text_id = 2021
# text = With regard to the composition , I shall propose an outside Chairman , nonpartisan and of experience , as was the case in the Lytton Committee , nine Members of this House chosen in the usual way that they are chosen for Select Committees and in the usual proportions , which , I think , will be five from the Government side and four from the different sections of the Opposition .
