# text = I am sure the Committee must have sympathised with the right hon . Gentleman the Minister of Labour , for during the last half - hour quite clearly he was speaking only partially his own mind and not giving the Committee , with the same freedom which he might have done had he been sitting on the opposite side of the House , exactly his own attitude towards the Washington Convention .
