# text_id = 2030
# text = I am not going to argue whether it was right or wrong , whether it was wise or foolish , for the French to enter the Ruhr ; but I can argue that , if the right hon . Gentleman the Member for Carnarvon Boroughs had remained Prime Minister of this country , he would hardly have been more successful in his approaches to our Allies than the present Prime Minister .
