# text = On behalf of the London County Council we are at the present time dealing with insanitary areas in such a way that we are prepared to be able to do away with a large amount of insanitary property in as economical a manner as possible , but , at the same time , as satisfactory a way as possible , as soon as the supply of houses has overtaken the demand .
