# text = Admitting , as every reasonable man must admit , that during the period of the War there were certain good reasons why difficulties would have to be met and could not be overcome , yet we have passed that stage , and I have yet to learn that much has been done by these companies to study in a reasonable and proper manner the necessities of the travelling public .
