# text = There was a statement there — upon whose authority it was issued I do not know , but I imagine on the authority of the Secretary of State for War — to the effect that the Government would undertake to support either now or at a later time any acts by members of the armed forces which were undertaken in the honest belief that they were for the general wellbeing .
