# text = The right hon . Gentleman has now seen the folly of that proposition , and the Report of the Committee on Government Financial assistance to Civil Air Transport Companies makes it perfectly clear that the gentlemen who sat upon that Committee understand exactly what has taken place , because the Committee in paragraph after paragraph advise the Air Ministry and the Government to adopt a new financial subsidy policy .
