# text_id = 2035
# text = It seems to me that that was a real deterrent against employment of alien seamen upon British ships , and I am not at all satisfied — I am willing to hear any explanations the Minister has to give — that the Amendment now proposed by the Minister will not make it easier for British shipowners to employ alien seamen at a lower rate than is paid to British seamen .
