# text_id = 2036
# text = So far , this Debate has been characterised by a moderate amount of criticism , a very considerable amount of approval and a remarkable speech from my Noble Friend the President of the Board of Education , outlining a programme of development in central schools and technical schools , and of co-operation in the development of the training of teachers on right lines , between the universities and other authorities .
