# text = Lieut .-Colonel RUDKIN asked the Minister of Transport if he is aware that fast - moving traffic is frequently held up for long intervals in main thoroughfares during the busiest time of the day by hand carts , donkey carts , lorries , and other slow - moving vehicles ; and will he consider the possibility of putting such regulations in force as will ameliorate or remove this evil ?
