# text = As a matter of fact , my hon . Friend the Member for Hillsborough showed that there was a question whether you would not , by protecting razor blades , affect the production of steel manufactured for the manufacture of those same blades , and , by giving a small measure of protection to the manufacturer of razor blades , prevent employment so far as the steel manufacturer himself was concerned .
