# text = But an analysis of the figures of unemployment in the industry shows that the percentage out of work is 5·7 on an average So that it seems to me that we could well afford to mete out special treatment to this class of worker by making his contribution a low one and a reasonable one or , at all events , a maximum one not exceeding 4d . per week .
