# text_id = 2042
# text = I can imagine his assuring the House in answer to that suggestion that , there are millions of other tenants of privately - owned property who would probably oppose any such proposal , but I should say , on the contrary , that he might also ask them for their vote by making them a somewhat similar offer , and that he might thus assure himself of an overwhelming majority .
