# text_id = 2043
# text = I am sure there is not an hon . Member on this side or the other side of the House who will grudge the expenditure of £ 48,000 for milk and food for the children who come under the pro visions of the Act , but I would like to ask , was it spent upon an extra supply of milk and food , or was it due to increased prices ?
