# text = The expenses of juries at Assizes in each of the years I have mentioned is put down at £ 300 in spite of the increase in disorder , and the defence of prisoners in cases of murder at £ 250 — in each of those years — while the extra expenses of traversers and their witnesses in cases at Winter Assizes is estimated at £ 800 in each year .
