# text = It may be argued that what I am dealing with involves only a small sum in each household , but the Colwyn Report is adverse to the continuance of these imposts , and they point out that the sum spent per head on the tea consumed by the population in this country in 1925 – 26 was 2s . 7d. , and that that was not a negligible figure .
