# text = I am not going to say that more markets have not been gained in South America , in Brazil , or in some parts of Europe , but , notwithstanding the price being reduced so much as compared with three years ago , the export of coal during the first 10 months of this year is lower by 1,500,000 tons as compared with the first 10 months of last year .
