# text_id = 2050
# text = I should like to know from him whether he really accepts the doctrine that if you tax one article and people try to economise — the word " evade " has been used — by using another article it is sound financial doctrine that you must tax it in order , if possible , to make them use the particular article from which you mainly hope to get your revenue .
