# text = It only goes to show how vast is the permeation of the Socialist party that is taking place at present , due mainly to the slow , gradual dripping in of extreme Liberals of a curious type into the party , and the influence of those who get in on the party councils , not I think possibly in the best interests of the party or the nation as a whole .
