# text = My noble friend , who was leading the House on that occasion , thought — no doubt it was my fault — that I was making a suggestion that there should be a Parliamentary Inquiry into local taxation generally , but when he saw that he had misunderstood me he said that if I could bring forward arguments to justify my suggestion , consideration would be given to it .
