# text = Our summer holidays are changing , and people are getting more attracted by country life , and they indulge in it , as a rule , running about in motor cars , and the habit of using motor chars - a - banc is becoming more and more a national habit , not only on the main roads , but on the by - roads and the unclassified roads .
