# text = That is , in every sense of the term , the private preserve of the Combine , and I should say , from the figures quoted by my hon . Friend the Member for Finsbury ( Mr. Gillett ) in the last Debate , that it is for that undertaking an exceedingly profitable thing and that the Combine are not anxious that there should be any interference with that common fund .
