# text = We only ask that there should be not less than one commissioned pharmacist , possibly of senior rank , supported by an officer of junior rank in each Army hospital at home and abroad with a senior commissioned pharmacist officer at the War Office ; or , if that is not possible , then an officer of senior rank operating under the medical officers in each hospital at home and abroad .
