# text_id = 2072
# text = I had certainly hoped that one of the reasons for the Air Ministry would have been that a great part of the coastguard service of this country could have been taken away from the antediluvian methods at present employed of men walking and handed over to an air machine which would patrol as great a distance effectively in half an hour as a man might walk in half a lifetime .
