# text = Mr. C. EDWARDS asked the Prime Minister whether , in the interest of the payees and with a view to providing a pension scheme for persons of 60 years of age , he will consider the appointment of a Commission to consider the desirability of co-ordinating all friendly society business , health and unemployment insurance , compensation schemes , and all agencies dealing with relief during incapacity from work ?
