# text_id = 2074
# text = When Mr. Montagu and I made the suggestion of this Committee in our Report , we had not any idea of setting up any addition to the machinery which deals with India in this country , but we were impressed by the desirability of keeping Parliament informed with regard to the trend of affairs in India , and we regarded this Committee as a stage in the educative process .
